evel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>&lt;</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></menclose><mi>y</mi></mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></menclose></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>&lt;</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, let's swap the left and right-hand sides so that the variable is on the left-hand side. Remember, we also need to flip the inequality.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div></div>",
